<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The study developed a 300 W NUVERA PEM fuel cell to extend an e-bike's range from 25 km to 120 km using a 5L, 200-bar hydrogen bottle. A PLC managed operations and safety, with custom voltage sensors minimizing power use. The system achieved 31% efficiency over 50 hours of testing and proved reliable in road tests, showcasing fuel cell potential for light electric vehicles. [2])
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
